            description: [
                "Basic Slag, Wood Ash and 100 mB of Ammonia in the Chemical Reactor give two NPK Fertilizer: +15 nutrients, and it enriches Loam to grow at 2×. One NPK and 1,000 mB of water make 1,000 mB of Nutrient Solution for the Hydroponic Cell and Greenhouse.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:npk_fertilizer}, {item:arcforge:nutrient_solution_bucket}"
